  "behavior": [
    "VoiceReconcile is an optional independently declared read-only capability. It requires status and cleanup, without requiring permission to create. Unimplemented default refuses before transport. Existing synthetic profiles explicitly omit the new unsupported operation.",
    "Vapi start_receipt submits the original mutation with one stable opaque forty-character call name, using the selected private-key reference and SDK retries disabled. The public canonical fixture exercises a503 lost create response, retains unknown, restarts the worker, correlates the original actual-SDK resource and observes terminal cleanup without another POST or manufactured Session acceptance/media. Eight canonical voice-flow cases pass, including the existing five original functional requirements and a separate HTTP-End-after-positive-correlation case.",
    "Correlated account lookup uses original assistant, phone, full destination and the fixed original grant window: expiry minus configured timeout minus60 seconds through that same expiry plus60 seconds. Vapi lists authenticated account creation-time windows, splits saturated pages inclusively, bounds request count/decoded bytes, requires one matching opaque correlation/type/assistant/phone/destination/time, and re-gets that resource to check the full binding again. Caller ID alone cannot select a resource.",
    "Empty history, an unrelated same-caller call, multiple matches, malformed/mismatched scope, incomplete saturated history, a changed fresh resource binding or any failed lookup retains uncertainty. The adapter issues no create or End during lookup. The Store records no invented authenticated observation, negative absence proof, quota release or new effect on those outcomes.",
    "Only an original started unknown outbound effect without an attributed resource or existing binding quarantine can obtain reconciliation custody. Start/submitting/known-resource/unsupported cases refuse. The query never renews the original start grant. Positive explicit Reconciliation evidence confirms the original creation effect and updates the independently revised provider projection/journal; the original generic Session receipt stays immutable.",
    "Exclusive worker restart does not redial. Admitted original-resource observation/cleanup custody can complete after original caller revocation while public replay still enforces current authorization. A known nonterminal resource receives its once-only original cleanup effect; a correlated terminal resource confirms a separate cleanup compensation without sending End. Failed/uncorrelated receipts cannot settle the unknown effect.",
    "A correlated provider ID already owned by another call is retained privately as a binding conflict, with no attributed capability or quota release. A stale concurrently admitted lookup cannot attach another resource after that quarantine. Existing quarantine cannot be cleared by ordinary correlation; explicit typed quarantine resolution remains open."
  ],
