    "The final authentication audit makes actual SDK and canonical-host HTTP fixture create/list/Get responses require the selected bearer key. Only the affected connector16 and voice_flow8 suites were rerun after this test-only change; other current-turn qualified binary hashes remain unchanged, recorded separately.",
